.TH okf-jawn-search_items 1  "search_items " 
.SH NAME
okf\-jawn\-search_items \- Search authorized content and return cited snippets, not whole\-document dumps.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBokf\-jawn search_items\fR [\fB\-\-server\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Search authorized content and return cited snippets, not whole\-document dumps.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-server\fR [default: http://127.0.0.1:7711]

.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR [default: {}]
JSON request, @file, or \- for stdin
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
